<div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_1be_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" data-markdown-text-tone="tertiary" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Recuperada arquitectura, requisitos, misiones y recursos de NOVA</span></p></div></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block-BQZwFn"><div data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-5:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-5:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="c07af307-655f-485a-b3b2-11932ce342e6 c07af307-655f-485a-b3b2-11932ce342e6"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT dijo:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div data-response-body="c07af307-655f-485a-b3b2-11932ce342e6"><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:d269db90-c3fb-49e1-ab05-643bb47656c3" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="c07af307-655f-485a-b3b2-11932ce342e6"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_1ap_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="c07af307-655f-485a-b3b2-11932ce342e6" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="5" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-temL23 DilResponseRoot-fdCmoC Reveal-eHl_0F" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="c07af307-655f-485a-b3b2-11932ce342e6"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">¡Ahora sí! Vamos a rehacer NOVA con las cuatro misiones nuevas y con los archivos bien separados, para que no dependa todo de JavaScript.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">La estructura será:</span></p><div data-client-defined-widget="code_block"><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default CodeSurface-UAMd1A Surface-BCuIs1 dark @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none gap-2 ActionBar-KWWAct min-h-12 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-RZfVQh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-65c0f11497ac4847.svg#codex-icon-code-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><div class="min-w-0 truncate flex-1">Texto sin formato</div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center min-w-0 max-w-full"><div data-code-block-controls="true" role="presentation" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-px print:hidden flex-wrap justify-end"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover aria-pressed:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Activar ajuste de línea" aria-pressed="false" data-state="closed"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-65c0f11497ac4847.svg#codex-icon-text-overflow-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover aria-pressed:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Copiar código" data-state="closed"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-65c0f11497ac4847.svg#codex-icon-square-on-square-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div data-code-block-source="true" class="text-size-chat overflow-auto outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-inset Source-kILllF whitespace-pre px-4 pt-0 pb-3 md:px-5 chatgpt-code-scrollport InlineCodePane-EYx4bd" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! block text-size-code CodeContent-ybJ8Tl min-w-max"><span>NOVA-SPACE-EXPLORATION/
│
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── script.js
└── images/
    ├── apollo-module.jpg
    ├── lunar-rover.jpg
    ├── sojourner.jpg
    └── ingenuity.jpg</span></code></div></div></div></div><ul class="List-bYalj1" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">HTML:</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> portada, tarjetas, imágenes, paneles y contenido.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">CSS:</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> diseño cinematográfico, animaciones y adaptación a pantallas.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">JavaScript:</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> navegación, interacciones y escenarios 3D con Three.js.</span></p></div></div></li></ul><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">No voy a hacer que JavaScript construya toda la página: las imágenes de las misiones estarán directamente en el HTML.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Recuperé también los requisitos que habías indicado: interfaz completamente en inglés, exploración en primera persona, tutorial, objetivos educativos, mapa más amplio, movimiento más rápido, escenarios lunares y marcianos diferenciados y una pantalla al completar cada misión.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">Una aclaración importante:</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> el JavaScript anterior quedó incompleto en la parte de Apollo, así que no puedo recuperar literalmente ese archivo. Para evitar que pegues código cortado o incompatible, voy a reconstruir los tres archivos como una versión nueva y coherente, manteniendo esos requisitos.</span></p><h2 class="TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">1. </strong></span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">index.html</span></code></h2><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Borrá el contenido anterior de </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">index.html</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> y pegá esto:</span></p><div data-client-defined-widget="code_block"><div data-chatgpt-copy-code="&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;NOVA | Space Exploration&lt;/title&gt;

    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;

    &lt;script src=&quot;https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;

&lt;body&gt;

    &lt;div id=&quot;star-background&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;!-- HOME SCREEN --&gt;
    &lt;main id=&quot;home-screen&quot; class=&quot;screen active&quot;&gt;

        &lt;header class=&quot;topbar&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;logo&quot;&gt;NOVA&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;topbar-label&quot;&gt;SPACE EXPLORATION PROGRAM&lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/header&gt;

        &lt;section class=&quot;hero&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;hero-content&quot;&gt;
                &lt;p class=&quot;eyebrow&quot;&gt;A NEW WAY TO EXPLORE SPACE&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;h1&gt;BEYOND&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;THE UNKNOWN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

                &lt;p class=&quot;hero-description&quot;&gt;
                    Discover historic space exploration missions.
                    Explore distant worlds, investigate abandoned
                    spacecraft and uncover the history of space exploration.
                &lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;button id=&quot;start-button&quot; class=&quot;primary-button&quot;&gt;
                    START EXPLORATION &lt;span&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;hero-coordinate&quot;&gt;
                NOVA EXPLORATION SYSTEM&lt;br&gt;
                00° 00' 00&quot; N / 00° 00' 00&quot; E
            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/section&gt;

        &lt;section class=&quot;missions-section&quot;&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;section-heading&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;p class=&quot;eyebrow&quot;&gt;MISSION DATABASE&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;h2&gt;SELECT YOUR MISSION&lt;/h2&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;span class=&quot;mission-counter&quot;&gt;04 MISSIONS AVAILABLE&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;mission-grid&quot;&gt;

                &lt;article class=&quot;mission-card&quot; data-mission=&quot;apollo&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;mission-image&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;img src=&quot;images/apollo-module.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Apollo Lunar Module&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;span class=&quot;mission-number&quot;&gt;001&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;

                    &lt;div class=&quot;mission-info&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;span class=&quot;location-tag&quot;&gt;THE MOON&lt;/span&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;APOLLO LUNAR MODULE&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;p&gt;Investigate the remains of the Apollo lunar landing system.&lt;/p&gt;
                        &lt;button class=&quot;mission-button&quot;&gt;EXPLORE MISSION →&lt;/button&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/article&gt;

                &lt;article class=&quot;mission-card&quot; data-mission=&quot;lrv&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;mission-image&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;img src=&quot;images/lunar-rover.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Lunar Roving Vehicle&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;span class=&quot;mission-number&quot;&gt;002&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;

                    &lt;div class=&quot;mission-info&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;span class=&quot;location-tag&quot;&gt;THE MOON&lt;/span&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;LUNAR ROVING VEHICLE&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;p&gt;Discover the electric vehicle used by Apollo astronauts.&lt;/p&gt;
                        &lt;button class=&quot;mission-button&quot;&gt;EXPLORE MISSION →&lt;/button&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/article&gt;

                &lt;article class=&quot;mission-card&quot; data-mission=&quot;sojourner&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;mission-image&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;img src=&quot;images/sojourner.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Sojourner Mars Rover&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;span class=&quot;mission-number&quot;&gt;003&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;

                    &lt;div class=&quot;mission-info&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;span class=&quot;location-tag mars-tag&quot;&gt;MARS&lt;/span&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;SOJOURNER ROVER&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;p&gt;Explore the first rover to operate on the Martian surface.&lt;/p&gt;
                        &lt;button class=&quot;mission-button&quot;&gt;EXPLORE MISSION →&lt;/button&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/article&gt;

                &lt;article class=&quot;mission-card&quot; data-mission=&quot;ingenuity&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;mission-image&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;img src=&quot;images/ingenuity.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ingenuity Mars Helicopter&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;span class=&quot;mission-number&quot;&gt;004&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;

                    &lt;div class=&quot;mission-info&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;span class=&quot;location-tag mars-tag&quot;&gt;MARS&lt;/span&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;INGENUITY HELICOPTER&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;p&gt;Investigate the first aircraft to fly on another planet.&lt;/p&gt;
                        &lt;button class=&quot;mission-button&quot;&gt;EXPLORE MISSION →&lt;/button&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/article&gt;

            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/section&gt;

        &lt;footer class=&quot;main-footer&quot;&gt;
            NOVA SPACE EXPLORATION © 2026
            &lt;span&gt;INSPIRED BY SPACE SCIENCE AND EXPLORATION&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/footer&gt;

    &lt;/main&gt;


    &lt;!-- BRIEFING SCREEN --&gt;
    &lt;section id=&quot;briefing-screen&quot; class=&quot;screen&quot;&gt;

        &lt;header class=&quot;subpage-header&quot;&gt;
            &lt;button class=&quot;back-button&quot; id=&quot;back-home&quot;&gt;← BACK TO MISSIONS&lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;logo&quot;&gt;NOVA&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/header&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;briefing-container&quot;&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;briefing-image&quot;&gt;
                &lt;img id=&quot;briefing-image&quot; src=&quot;&quot; alt=&quot;Mission preview&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;image-overlay&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;span id=&quot;briefing-number&quot;&gt;MISSION 001&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;briefing-content&quot;&gt;
                &lt;p class=&quot;eyebrow&quot; id=&quot;briefing-location&quot;&gt;THE MOON&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;h1 id=&quot;briefing-title&quot;&gt;MISSION TITLE&lt;/h1&gt;

                &lt;p id=&quot;briefing-description&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;div class=&quot;briefing-data&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;span&gt;DESTINATION&lt;/span&gt;
                        &lt;strong id=&quot;briefing-destination&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;

                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;span&gt;MISSION TYPE&lt;/span&gt;
                        &lt;strong id=&quot;briefing-type&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;

                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;span&gt;YEAR&lt;/span&gt;
                        &lt;strong id=&quot;briefing-year&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;div class=&quot;objective-box&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;p class=&quot;eyebrow&quot;&gt;YOUR OBJECTIVE&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;h3&gt;INVESTIGATE THE ENVIRONMENT&lt;/h3&gt;
                    &lt;p id=&quot;briefing-objective&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;button id=&quot;launch-button&quot; class=&quot;primary-button&quot;&gt;
                    BEGIN EXPLORATION →
                &lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;


    &lt;!-- TUTORIAL --&gt;
    &lt;section id=&quot;tutorial-screen&quot; class=&quot;screen tutorial-screen&quot;&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;tutorial-box&quot;&gt;
            &lt;p class=&quot;eyebrow&quot;&gt;NOVA FIELD GUIDE&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;h1&gt;EXPLORATION PROTOCOL&lt;/h1&gt;

            &lt;p class=&quot;tutorial-intro&quot;&gt;
                Before entering the environment, review your exploration controls.
            &lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;controls-grid&quot;&gt;

                &lt;div class=&quot;control-item&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;key-group&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;kbd&gt;W&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;A&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;S&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;D&lt;/kbd&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;strong&gt;MOVE&lt;/strong&gt;
                        &lt;span&gt;Walk through the environment.&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;div class=&quot;control-item&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;key-group&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;kbd&gt;MOUSE&lt;/kbd&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;strong&gt;LOOK AROUND&lt;/strong&gt;
                        &lt;span&gt;Move your mouse to observe the area.&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;div class=&quot;control-item&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;key-group&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;kbd&gt;E&lt;/kbd&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;strong&gt;INVESTIGATE&lt;/strong&gt;
                        &lt;span&gt;Examine nearby discoveries.&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;div class=&quot;control-item&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;key-group&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;kbd&gt;ESC&lt;/kbd&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;strong&gt;PAUSE&lt;/strong&gt;
                        &lt;span&gt;Release the mouse pointer.&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;tutorial-note&quot;&gt;
                &lt;strong&gt;MISSION REMINDER&lt;/strong&gt;
                &lt;p&gt;Explore the area and investigate all marked discoveries to complete your mission.&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;button id=&quot;tutorial-start&quot; class=&quot;primary-button&quot;&gt;
                ENTER ENVIRONMENT →
            &lt;/button&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;/section&gt;


    &lt;!-- EXPLORATION SCREEN --&gt;
    &lt;section id=&quot;exploration-screen&quot; class=&quot;screen exploration-screen&quot;&gt;

        &lt;div id=&quot;three-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;header class=&quot;game-header&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;game-logo&quot;&gt;NOVA&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;game-mission&quot;&gt;
                &lt;span id=&quot;game-mission-number&quot;&gt;MISSION 001&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;strong id=&quot;game-mission-title&quot;&gt;APOLLO LUNAR MODULE&lt;/strong&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;button id=&quot;exit-exploration&quot;&gt;EXIT MISSION ✕&lt;/button&gt;
        &lt;/header&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;game-hud&quot;&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;hud-panel objective-panel&quot;&gt;
                &lt;span class=&quot;eyebrow&quot;&gt;MISSION OBJECTIVES&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;h3 id=&quot;objective-progress&quot;&gt;0 / 3 DISCOVERIES&lt;/h3&gt;

                &lt;div class=&quot;progress-track&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div id=&quot;progress-fill&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;p id=&quot;objective-description&quot;&gt;Investigate the environment.&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;hud-panel location-panel&quot;&gt;
                &lt;span class=&quot;eyebrow&quot;&gt;CURRENT LOCATION&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;strong id=&quot;current-location&quot;&gt;LUNAR SURFACE&lt;/strong&gt;
                &lt;span id=&quot;environment-status&quot;&gt;ENVIRONMENT STABLE&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;crosshair&quot;&gt;+&lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div id=&quot;interaction-prompt&quot;&gt;
            PRESS &lt;kbd&gt;E&lt;/kbd&gt; TO INVESTIGATE
        &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div id=&quot;discovery-message&quot; class=&quot;discovery-message&quot;&gt;
            &lt;span class=&quot;eyebrow&quot;&gt;DISCOVERY LOGGED&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;h3 id=&quot;discovery-title&quot;&gt;OBJECT FOUND&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;p id=&quot;discovery-description&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;button id=&quot;close-discovery&quot;&gt;CONTINUE EXPLORATION&lt;/button&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;minimap&quot;&gt;
            &lt;span class=&quot;eyebrow&quot;&gt;AREA MAP&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;canvas id=&quot;map-canvas&quot; width=&quot;150&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/canvas&gt;
            &lt;span&gt;EXPLORATION ZONE&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;game-controls&quot;&gt;
            WASD: MOVE &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; MOUSE: LOOK &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; E: INVESTIGATE
        &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div id=&quot;pause-message&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div&gt;
                &lt;h2&gt;EXPLORATION PAUSED&lt;/h2&gt;
                &lt;p&gt;Click to resume your mission.&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;/section&gt;


    &lt;!-- MISSION COMPLETE --&gt;
    &lt;section id=&quot;complete-screen&quot; class=&quot;screen complete-screen&quot;&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;complete-content&quot;&gt;
            &lt;p class=&quot;eyebrow&quot;&gt;NOVA MISSION REPORT&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;complete-symbol&quot;&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;h1&gt;MISSION&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;COMPLETED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

            &lt;p id=&quot;complete-description&quot;&gt;
                All exploration objectives have been completed.
            &lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;complete-stats&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;span&gt;MISSION&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;strong id=&quot;complete-mission-name&quot;&gt;MISSION NAME&lt;/strong&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;span&gt;DISCOVERIES&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;strong id=&quot;complete-discoveries&quot;&gt;3 / 3&lt;/strong&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;span&gt;STATUS&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;strong&gt;SUCCESSFUL&lt;/strong&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;button id=&quot;return-home&quot; class=&quot;primary-button&quot;&gt;
                RETURN TO MISSION DATABASE →
            &lt;/button&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;/section&gt;


    &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
