raction" aria-label="Agregar a favoritos" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-pressed="false" id="radix-_r_1en_" data-state="closed"><span class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-none bg-transparent group-hover/gallery-action:bg-media-background/25 group-focus/gallery-action:bg-media-background/25"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-65c0f11497ac4847.svg#codex-icon-bookmark-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="Frame-UCrMGp"></div></div></div><div class="Box-JYjgF4" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="flex: 1 1 0%; gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">ingenuity.jpg</span></code></span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-size="xs" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(205, 205, 205);">Ingenuity Helicopter — NASA</span></p></div></div></div><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">También podés agregar una imagen espacial de fondo llamada </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">space-background.jpg</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">. Si no la colocás, la portada seguirá funcionando, pero tendrá el fondo oscuro.</span></p><h2 class="TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">5. Cómo probarlo</strong></span></h2><ol class="List-bYalj1" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Guardá los tres archivos.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Verificá que los nombres coincidan exactamente.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Abrí </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">index.html</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> en el navegador.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Elegí una misión y presioná </span><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">BEGIN EXPLORATION</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Seguí el tutorial y entrá al escenario.</span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Usá WASD para moverte, el mouse para mirar y E para investigar.</span></p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">Una aclaración sobre esta versión:</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> es una base funcional nueva, con escenarios 3D generados mediante Three.js y descubrimientos interactivos. Los modelos son representaciones simplificadas, no reproducciones históricas exactas. Las fotografías de las tarjetas sí se cargan desde tu carpeta </span><code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">images</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Después podemos mejorar cada escenario con modelos 3D más fieles, texturas de terreno y detalles históricos de NASA.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:mt-3 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 browser:-ms-0.5 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data