nt:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT dijo:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div data-response-body="46f3bd3f-aa0f-40fb-b8ba-c29b2a3dcbf0"><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:d269db90-c3fb-49e1-ab05-643bb47656c3" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="46f3bd3f-aa0f-40fb-b8ba-c29b2a3dcbf0"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_1gv_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="46f3bd3f-aa0f-40fb-b8ba-c29b2a3dcbf0" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="1" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="dark" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-temL23 DilResponseRoot-fdCmoC Reveal-eHl_0F" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="46f3bd3f-aa0f-40fb-b8ba-c29b2a3dcbf0"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">¡Es sencillo! Te explico paso a paso en Windows para que las fotografías aparezcan en las tarjetas de NOVA.</p><h2 class="TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">1. Abrí la carpeta de tu proyec