    └── ingenuity.jpg</span></code></div></div></div></div><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Después actualizá la página del navegador con <code class="Code-LNMR8q" data-d-component="code">F5</code>.</p><div class="Divider-aIXBUs" data-d-component="divider" style="--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;"></div><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">Una pregunta:</strong></span> ¿estás usando Visual Studio Code para editar NOVA? Si es así, puedo mostrarte exactamente dónde hacer clic para crear la carpeta y colocar las imágenes.</p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none block h-0"></span><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:mt-3 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 browser:-ms-0.5 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-